        given-names: Marijn J. H.
  - type: software
    title: CaDiCaL
    version: 3.0.1
    abstract: CDCL SAT solver; produced the DRAT proofs.
    authors:
      - family-names: Biere
        given-names: Armin
  - type: software
    title: PySAT
    version: 1.9.dev7
    abstract: >-
      Provided the cardinality-constraint encodings (seqcounter and kmtotalizer).
      The published CNF hashes depend on this exact version.
    authors:
